abstract: >
  A structured educational portfolio demonstrating systematic development
  of clinical reasoning in critical care medicine. Includes simulated ICU
  cases, physiologic analysis, shock frameworks, ventilatory strategies,
  and interdisciplinary decision-making models aligned with critical care
  educational frameworks. Designed as a longitudinal academic project
  documenting structured learning for premedical physiology study.

